Revision history for Perl-Critic-Policy-ProhibitUnusedDefinitions

0.007 2026-10-24 TEODESIAN
    - Count a method call from a sub of the same name as a use, unless its
      invocant is the sub's own first argument.  Delegation to another
      object's method of the same name, and a call through SUPER from an
      override, were taken for recursion, and the subs they reach were
      reported as never called.

0.006 2026-10-22 TEODESIAN
    - Take the subs that perl calls, the cache and cache_dir parameters, and
      the walk of a document from Perl::Critic::Distribution 0.002, which
      ProhibitMisplacedMethods shares.
    - Declare the prerequisites in prereqs.yml.  [PrereqsFile] does not read
      prereqs.yaml, so its pins never reached the metadata.

0.005 2026-10-08 TEODESIAN
    - Read the distribution through Perl::Critic::Distribution, which parses
      each file once for every policy that needs the whole distribution, and
      keeps the cache that this policy kept.  The cache moves to
      ~/.cache/perl-critic-distribution, so the first run after an upgrade
      parses every file once.  An old cache in
      ~/.cache/perl-critic-prohibitunuseddefinitions is no longer read, and
      can be deleted.

0.004 2026-09-18 TEODESIAN
    - Keep each file's uses resolved in the cache, with a digest of the
      definitions they were resolved against.  While no definition changes,
      only the changed files are resolved again.
    - Compress the cache with gzip, and on each write remove the cache of any
      distribution whose root is gone, such as a deleted checkout.

0.003 2026-09-18 TEODESIAN
    - Keep the index of each distribution on disk between runs, as JSON, and
      parse again only the files whose stat changed.  An editor that starts
      a new process for every check, such as PerlNavigator, no longer parses
      the whole distribution each time.  New parameters: cache, cache_dir.

0.002 2026-09-14 TEODESIAN
    - Fix issue with not detecting interpolated sub calls

0.001 2026-09-11 TEODESIAN
    - Initial Release
